# Cloudflare Workers static assets read this file; it is not served.
#
# A hashed file never changes under its name, so a browser keeps it for a year and never asks again.
# The app is served at the root of `app.brain.dog`, so its hashed files are too.
#
# THE FONTS ARE HASHED BY THEIR ADDRESS. `tokens.css` and the shell ask for each one with `?v=` and
# the first four hex of the file's SHA-256 (`src/lib/fonts.test.ts` holds them equal), so a new font
# is a new address and the old one may be kept for a year like a chunk.
#
# THE TAB'S MARKS ARE KEPT FOR A DAY. A browser asks for the tab icon again on every move inside the
# app, and at `max-age=0` each ask was a round trip of 130 to 650 ms beside the page's own reads.
# They are not hashed, so a new mark is seen within a day, and a week more may show the old one
# while the new one is fetched behind it.
#
# Everything else (the shell) keeps the platform's default, so a deploy is seen on the next load.
/_app/immutable/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/fonts/*
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=31536000, immutable

/favicon.ico
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/mark-small.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/mark-alpha.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800

/mark.svg
  Cache-Control: public, max-age=86400, stale-while-revalidate=604800
